# GitHub deploy habit

Whenever you finish implementing user-requested code changes in this project:

1. Commit the relevant files (only when the user asked to commit/push, or they already asked to keep GitHub updated — this project has an ongoing push request).
2. Push to `origin` on `main`.
3. Reply with the live site URL:
   **https://valentynpi.github.io/Medieval-game/**

If the GitHub username/repo differs, use `gh repo view --json url,nameWithOwner` and form Pages as `https://<owner>.github.io/<repo>/`.

Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks unless the user asks.
